{"sourceUrl":"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/2025/0620/c888a412187/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:14.764886+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/2025/0620/c888a412187/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>为增进林学、草学、风景园林及相关领域优秀大学生之间的交流，选拔一批热爱科学，潜心研究的优秀大学生继续深造，我院拟于</span></span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span>-1</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日，在广州举办夏令营活动，欢迎有意报考我院</span></span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年硕士研究生的优秀学生参加。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>一、学院简介</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>华南农业大学是国家“双一流”建设高校，林学与风景园林学院是学校历史最悠久的学院之一。学院</span></span><span><span><span>现</span></span></span><span><span>有林学学科博士后流动站，林学一级学科博士学位授权点、风景园林专业博士学位授权点，林学和草学</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>个学术硕士学位授权点，林业、农艺与种业和风景园林</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>个专业硕士学位授权点。林学学科为国家林业局重点学科，农业科学与林学学科</span></span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>QS</span></span><span><span><span><span>全球排名前</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>28</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span><span>依托“</span></span></span><span><span>广东省森林植物种质创新与利用重点实验室</span></span><span><span><span>”、“</span></span></span><span><span>广东省木本饲料工程技术研究中心</span></span><span><span><span>”、“</span></span></span><span><span>广东省自然保护区研究中心</span></span><span><span><span>”、“</span></span></span><span><span>广东省草业工程技术研究中心</span></span><span><span><span>”、“</span></span></span><span><span>广东鹅凰嶂野外科学观测研究站</span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>个</span></span></span><span><span>省部级科研平台</span></span><span><span><span>，与众多科研院所、政府机构及行业龙头企业建立了紧密的产学研合作关系，并建有</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span><span><span><span>个研究生联合培养基地</span></span></span><span><span>，其中与广州普邦园林股份有限公司、广州海珠湿地公园共建基地获批全国示范性研究生培养基地。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span><span>师资力量卓越</span></span></span><span><span>现有教授</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>人，副教授</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>人，拥有国家杰出青年科学基金获得者、全国模范教师、省级教学名师等高水平导师队伍。近年来，学院荣获国家科技进步二等奖、高等教育国家级教学成果奖一等奖、教育部高等学校科学研究优秀成果奖（科学技术）一等奖、广东省科技进步奖一等奖，大北农科技奖一等奖、广东省“五一劳动奖章”、第五届全国高校混合式教学设计创新大赛一等奖，第五届全国高校青年教师教学竞赛二等奖、广东省“工人先锋号”集体荣誉称号。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>2026年研究生拟招生专业为林学（0907）、草学（0909）学术学位硕士研究生，风景园林（0862）、农艺与种业（095131）、林业（0954）专业学位硕士研究生，正式招生专业目录以学校公布为准。</span></p><p><span><span><span><span>二、夏令营安排</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1. 202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年“华南农业大学林学与风景园林学院优秀大学生夏令营”活动将于</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日至</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日举行，计划招收营员</span></span></span></span><span><span>30~</span></span><span><span><span>40</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>人</span></span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>不包含本校营员</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营期间，将开展开营仪式、学校和学院介绍、实验室参观、名家讲座、师生交流、优秀大学生个人风采展示等环节，零距离感受学院学科建设、科学研究、研究生培养和专家风采等百年名校综合魅力。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>学院将对</span></span><span><span><span>全程参与</span></span></span><span><span>夏令营的同学颁发</span></span><span><span><span>结营证书</span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span><span><span><span>学院为学员购买活动期间保险，提供免费住宿，餐补，广州市外高校学生提供定额交通补助（校内营员仅提供餐补）。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>三</span></span></span><span><span>、申请条件</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，遵纪守法，诚实守信，品德良好，身心健康；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span><span>国内高校对口专业</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年本科应届毕业生；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>学习成绩优秀，本科前两年半平均绩点</span></span></span></span><span><span>3.0</span></span><span><span><span><span>以上，专业课成绩平均为</span></span></span></span><span><span>80</span></span><span><span><span><span>分以上，且有意到华南农业大学林学与风景园林学院深造的同学；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span><span><span>具有较强的英语能力，英语四级成绩在</span></span></span></span><span><span>425</span></span><span><span><span><span>分以上，通过英语六级者优先考虑；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span><span><span>科研能力突出者申请成绩标准可适当放宽（需提供获奖证书、发表论文或专利证书等相关证明材料）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>四</span></span></span><span><span>、申请方式及材料</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>申请时间：即日起开始报名，报名截止时间为</span></span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span>17:30</span></span><span><span><span><span>，逾期不再接受申请。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>申请方式：请在报名截至日期前将以下电子版材料压缩打包发至邮箱</span></span></span></span><span><span>3540564106</span></span><span><span><span>@qq.com</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span><span>叶</span></span></span><span><span>老师）。文件夹、邮件标题为：所在学校全称</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>本人姓名</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>专业名称</span></span></span></span><span><span>-202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年夏令营申请</span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>并扫码填写</span></span></span><span><span>华南农业大学林学与风景园林学院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年夏令营申请信息表</span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/88/de/399824f348fe84a71723f3704b17/ed94f7d5-f52d-4a84-946e-be15bff09260.png\"/></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>所需材料：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表（附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>，加盖所在单位公章）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）个人简介</span></span></span></span><span><span>word</span></span><span><span><span><span>电子版（附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>）成绩证明：前两年半的学习成绩单扫描件、绩点排名证明（附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>，加盖学校教务部门的学习成绩专用章）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>）英语水平证明：国家英语四、六级考试成绩或</span></span></span></span><span><span>TOEFL/GRE/GMAT/</span></span><span><span><span><span>雅思等成绩（扫描件）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>）身份证（正反面）、学生证（照片页和信息页）（扫描件）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>）经历证明：本科在读期间各类获奖情况、发表论文情况或获得授权专利等情况证明，按照学业科研获奖、德育获奖和文体获奖分类建立文件夹（扫描件）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>）具有副高级职称及以上的专家推荐信</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>封（签字、扫描件），专家推荐信参考模板见附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>）华南农业大学林学与风景园林学院</span></span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年夏令营报名信息汇总表（附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>五</span></span></span><span><span>、注意事项</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>报名结束后，学院将进行资格审核，择优录取，营员录取名单将在学院网站上公布，请营员在招生期间密切关注我院网站信息；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>学生须承诺所有申报材料和信息均属实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消本人参营资格，并通报给学生所在学校主管部门，同时保留进一步追溯的权利；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>参加夏令营的学生必须遵守华南农业大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排全程参加夏令营各项活动，如发现无故缺勤者或违反相关规定者，取消营员资格；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span><span><span>活动具体安排如有调整，届时将及时通知入选学员。欢迎加入“</span></span><span><span><span><span>华南农大林风学院</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年夏令营</span></span></span></span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>交流群（请以“所在学校</span></span></span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span><span><span>专业</span></span></span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span><span><span>姓名</span></span></span></span><span><span>+202</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营”申请进群），夏令营具体安排将通过交流群发布；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span><span><span>其他未尽事宜由华南农业大学林学与风景园林学院负责解释。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>六</span></span></span><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span><span>叶老师</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span>020-38207232</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span><a href=\"mailto:3540564106@qq.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">3540564106</a></span></span><a href=\"mailto:3540564106@qq.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>@qq.com</span></span></span></a></p><p><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>咨询交流群（附后）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>林学与风景园林学院网页</span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>https://lf.scau.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>招生信息请扫描关注华南农业大学研招办公众号查询了解或者参阅华南农业大学研究生院网页（</span></span></span></span><span><span>http://yjsglxt.scau.edu.cn/open/RecruitTkss/ZsDir_View.aspx</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/88/de/399824f348fe84a71723f3704b17/6e883532-5043-474b-939e-88143879c0ba.png\"/></p><p><span> “<span><span><span><span><span>华南农大林风学院</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年夏令营”</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>交流群</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/2025/0620/c888a412187/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/88/de/399824f348fe84a71723f3704b17/1ba2ed70-c01e-4957-9ae2-88ca181480fc.png\"/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>华南农业大学研招办公众号</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_rar.gif\"/><a href=\"https://lf.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/88/de/399824f348fe84a71723f3704b17/9d4f791a-ac09-4020-9ab0-f38a4ce16be1.zip\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"2025年华南农业大学林学与风景园林学院夏令营申请附件.zip\">2025年华南农业大学林学与风景园林学院夏令营申请附件.zip</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"0b78e0049964a29cb70ad7af4be04567a8252cb0a493941245dbd971cc4b5941","textLength":2372,"sourceSha256":"051b6df95fe08b0fff7aff08c0f749922d2cfc3f9a4d75e847b9cdc6db738b73","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9fad450a046d82cd3ee4","title":"2025年华南农业大学林学与风景园林学院关于举办2025年优秀大学生夏令营（线下）的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:14.764886+00:00"}
